    {
      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/drawers/today.props.ts",
      "content": "These guards do not establish that the Trade opened today. `AwaitingClose` also applies to lots opened after the latest completed close on a previous day: a Trade opened Monday after the close and viewed Tuesday before the close has no dated line and has at-entry figures, so this message incorrectly says it opened today. The same applies across weekends. Compare the opening's workspace-local date with the actual current date, or use date-neutral wording and show the opening date explicitly; cover an overnight opening in the tests.",
      "existing_code": "  return `No Marks yet. This Trade opened today${opened ? ` at ${clockTime(opened.economicTime, timeZone)}` : ''}. Its first Marks, and every figure that needs them, are due once today's session ends.`;",
